    S:gt.blockmachines.algaefarm.controller.tier.single.tooltip=Machine Type: §eAlgae Pond§r\n§4DEPRECATED - Controller will be removed in next major update!\n§4Check NEI for new Controller and conversion recipe\nGrows Algae!\nProvide compost to boost production by one tier\nDoes not require power or maintenance\nAll Machine Casings must be the same tier, this dictates machine speed\nFill Input Hatch with Water to fill the inside of the multiblock\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.algaefarm.controller.tier.single.tooltip.15545=Machine Type: §eAlgae Pond§r\nGrows Algae!\nProvide compost to boost production by one tier\nEnergy Hatch limited by §fGlass§7 Tier\nAccepts exactly 1 Energy Hatch\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines\nStructure by: §a§6IX§r§7
    S:gt.blockmachines.algaefarm.controller.tier.single.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §69§7x§69§7x§63§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front bottom center\n   §675+ §fMachine Casing §b(Tiered)\n   §664 §fSterile Farm Casing\n§f   Input Bus: §7Any Casing\n§f   Output Bus: §7Any Casing\n§f   Input Hatch: §7Any Casing\nSubchannel §bcasing§7 determines §bMachine Casing Tier\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.algaefarm.controller.tier.single.tooltip_secondary.15545=§fDimensions: §610§7x§63§7x§66§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front center, 3rd layer\n   §664 §fAny Tiered Glass §b(Tiered)\n   §620-25 §fAlgae Casing\n   §66 §fStainless Steel Frame Box\n   §65 §fFilter Machine Casing\n   §e1 §fEnergy Hatch: §7Any casing\n   §e1 §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any casing\n   §e0+ §fInput Bus: §7Any casing\n   §e0+ §fInput Hatch: §7Any casing\n   §e1+ §fOutput Bus: §7Any casing\n   \nSubchannel §bglass§7 determines §bGlass Tier\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.amazonprime.controller.tier.single.name=亚马逊仓库
    S:gt.blockmachines.amazonprime.controller.tier.single.tooltip=Machine Type: §ePackager, Unpackager, AWD§r\n§4DEPRECATED - Controller will be removed in next major update!\n§4Check NEI for new Controller and conversion recipe\nThis Multiblock is used for EXTREME packaging requirements\n§616§7 Parallels per §fVoltage§7 Tier\n§a600%§7 Speed\n§b75%§7 EU Usage\nCan be configured with a screwdriver to work as an Unpackager\nDust Schematics are inserted into the input buses\nIf inserted into the controller, it is shared across all buses\n1x, 2x, 3x & Other Schematics are to be placed into the controller GUI slot\n§540 §7Pollution per second\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.amazonprime.controller.tier.single.tooltip.15513=Machine Type: §ePackager, Unpackager, AWD§r\nThis Multiblock is used for EXTREME packaging requirements\nCan be configured to work as an Unpackager in controller\n§616§7 Parallels per §fVoltage§7 Tier\n§a+100%§7 Speed per §fItem Pipe Casing§7 Tier\n§b75%§7 EU Usage\n§540 §7Pollution per second\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines\nStructure by: §a§6Oasis_Cactus§r§7
    S:gt.blockmachines.amazonprime.controller.tier.single.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §63§7x§63§7x§63§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front center\n   §610+ §fSupply Depot Casing\n§f   Input Bus: §7Any Casing\n§f   Output Bus: §7Any Casing\n§f   Energy Hatch: §7Any Casing\n§f   Maintenance Hatch: §7Any Casing\n§f   Muffler Hatch: §7Any Casing\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.amazonprime.controller.tier.single.tooltip_secondary.15513=§fDimensions: §63§7x§65§7x§63§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front right, 2nd layer\n   §64-15 §fSupply Depot Casing\n   §63 §fItem Pipe Casing §b(Tiered)\n   §63 §fAny Tiered Glass\n   §62 §fIron Frame Box\n   §e1+ §fEnergy Hatch: §7Any casing\n   §e1 §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any casing\n   §e1 §fMuffler Hatch: §7Any casing\n   §e1+ §fInput Bus: §7Any casing\n   §e1+ §fOutput Bus: §7Any casing\n   \nSubchannel §bitem_pipe§7 determines §bItem Pipe Casing Tier\nSubchannel §bglass§7 determines §bGlass Tier\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.antimatterforge.name=半稳定反物质稳定序列器
    S:gt.blockmachines.antimatterforge.tooltip=Machine Type: §eAntimatter Forge, SSASS§r\n§dDimensions not included!§7\nConverts protomatter into antimatter\nUse screwdriver to disable rendering\nPassively consumes 10,000,000 + (§3Antimatter§7 * 1000)^(1.5 - §a§l§nM§r§7) EU/t\nThe consumption decays by 0.5% every tick when empty\nActively uses (§3Antimatter§7 * 10,000)^(1.5 - §5§l§nG§r§7) EU per cycle to produce antimatter\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nCycles every second\nEvery cycle, the lowest amount of antimatter in the 16 antimatter hatches is recorded\nAll hatches with more than the lowest amount §close half the difference!§7\n§cVoids 10% of antimatter §7if it runs out of energy/protomatter during a cycle\nBase production per hatch is (1/16) * (§3Antimatter§7^(0.5 + §6§l§nC§r§7)) of antimatter each cycle\nEach hatch multiplies the base production per hatch with a random number pulled from\na normal distribution with a mean of 0.2 + §b§l§nA§r§7 and a variance of 1\nThe total gain of antimatter can be negative!\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nCan be supplied with stabilization fluids to improve antimatter generation\nEach stabilization can only use one of the fluids at a time\n§a§l§nM§r§aagnetic Stabilization§7 (Consumes §3Antimatter§7^0.5 L of fluid per cycle)\n1. Molten Purified Tengam = §a0.1§7\n2. Tachyon Rich Fluid = §a0.2§7\n3. Molten MagMatter = §a0.3§7\n§5§l§nG§r§5ravity Stabilization§7 (Consumes §3Antimatter§7^0.5 L of fluid per cycle)\n1. Molten Spacetime = §50.05§7\n2. Spatially Enlarged Fluid = §50.10§7\n3. Molten Eternity = §50.15§7\n§6§l§nC§r§6ontainment Stabilization§7 (Consumes §3Antimatter§7^(2/7) L of fluid per cycle)\n1. Molten Shirabon = §60.05§7\n2. Molten MHDCSM = §60.10§7\n§b§l§nA§r§bctivation Stabilization§7 (Consumes §3Antimatter§7^(1/3) L of fluid per cycle)\n1. Depleted Naquadah Fuel Mk V = §b0.05§7\n2. Depleted Naquadah Fuel Mk VI = §b0.10§7\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.antimatterforge.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §647§7x§653§7x§653§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front center, 27th layer\n   §62274 §fMagnetic Flux Casing\n   §6624-637 §fGravity Stabilization Casing\n   §6514 §fAntimatter Containment Casing\n   §6126 §fProtomatter Activation Coil\n   §e1+ §fEnergy Hatch: §7Back, left, or right side of the structure\n   §e1+ §fInput Hatch: §7Top or bottom side of the structure\n   §e16 §fAntimatter Hatch: §7Around the inner ring\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.antimattergenerator.name=覆罩拉格朗日湮灭矩阵
    S:gt.blockmachines.antimattergenerator.tooltip=Machine Type: §eAntimatter Generator, SLAM§r\nAnnihilating Antimatter like it's 2205!\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nGenerates energy by reacting §bSemi-Stable Antimatter§7 with §6Matter\nAnnihilation uses an equal amount of §bAntimatter§7 and §6Matter\nConsumes §6all inputs§7 every processing cycle\n§cVoids any invalid fluid!\nA cycle lasts 5 seconds\nAn imbalance between §bAntimatter§7 and §6Matter§c decreases efficiency!§7\nEfficiency formula: Min(§bAntimatter§7/§6Matter§7, §6Matter§7/§bAntimatter§7)\nAny excess EU generated will be §cvoided!§7\nCannot produce more than §a9.22e18§7 EU per cycle\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nEnergy production formula: §a§l§nA§r§7 * (§bAntimatter§7 ^ §6§l§nE§r§7) EU/Cycle\n§a§l§nA§r§antimatter energy§7 base value: §a1.00e12§7 EU/L\n§6§l§nE§r§6nergy production boost§r§7:\n1. Molten Copper: §61.00\n2. Molten Superconductor Base UIV: §61.02\n3. Molten Superconductor Base UMV: §61.03\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nSwitch the power destination to your wireless network with a screwdriver\nWireless mode requires Superconductor Base UMV to work\nWireless mode is still limited by hatch capacity\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.antimattergenerator.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §635§7x§635§7x§643§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) §c(Hollow)\n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front center, 2nd layer\n   §64127-4128 §fMagnetic Flux Casing\n   §62481-2544 §fGravity Stabilization Casing\n   §61008 §fAny Transcendentally Reinforced Borosilicate Glass Block\n   §6600 §fAntimatter Annihilation Matrix\n   §6292 §fNaquadria Frame Box\n   §6209 §fAdvanced Filter Casing\n   §632 §fProtomatter Activation Coil\n   §e1-64 §fLaser Source Hatch: §7Any bottom leg casing\n   §e1-2 §fInput Hatch: §7Either center side casing\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
