    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.beam-crafter.tooltip=Machine Type: §eBeam Crafter, Beam Assembler§r\nCollides two beams of particles into target materials to modify\ntheir subatomic structure\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nInput Beams can be supplied to either Beam Input Hatch\nInputs are consumed immediately and will wait for particles\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nUp to §b2000000000§7 particles of each type can be buffered\nRecipe progress is determined purely by particles consumed\nfrom the buffer\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHas §61024§7 parallels\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§aSupports Multi-Amp and Laser Hatches!\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines\nAdded by: §aAuthor: §6Ham§fCorp§r§7
