    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.heatexchanger.tooltip=Machine Type: §eHeat Exchanger, LHE§r\nInputs are §cLava§7, §cHot Coolant§7, or §cHot Solar Salt\nOutputs are §9Pahoehoe Lava§7, §9IC2 Coolant§7, or §9Cold Solar Salt\nConverts distilled water into §rSteam§7 or §rSH Steam§7 in the process\nOutputs §rSH Steam§7 if the input rate of hot fluid is above a certain §dthreshold\nExplodes after 100s if it runs out of distilled water\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§cLava§7 | SH Threshold §d1,000 L/s§7 | Max Input §c2,000 L/s§7 | Max Output §r8,000 L/t SH Steam\n§cHot Coolant§7 | SH Threshold §d800 L/s§7 | Max Input §c1,600 L/s§7 | Max Output §r16,000 L/t SH Steam\n§cHot Solar Salt§7 | SH Threshold §d160 L/s§7 | Max Input §c320 L/s§7 | Max Output §r16,000 L/t SH Steam\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nA circuit in the controller lowers the SH threshold at the cost of steam\n§d-3.75%§7 SH Threshold and §r-1.5%§7 steam output per circuit over 1\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.heatexchanger.tooltip_secondary=§fDimensions: §63§7x§63§7x§64§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front bottom center\n   §620-28 §fStable Titanium Machine Casing\n   §62 §fTitanium Pipe Casing\n   §e1 §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any machine casing\n   §e2+ §fInput Hatch: §7Bottom center casing (hot fluid), any machine casing (distilled water)\n   §e2+ §fOutput Hatch: §7Top center casing (cool fluid), any machine casing (steam)\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.hipcompressor.name=热等静压单元
    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.hipcompressor.tooltip=Machine Type: §eCompressor, HIP§r\nHIP Unit heats up while running\nWhen it reaches maximum heat, it becomes §4§loverheated!\nThis is only resolved by letting the machine fully cool down\nWhen §4overheated§7, recipes are slowed down drastically\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nSome recipes §lrequire§r§7 HIP\nIf the machine is §4overheated§7 when one of these recipes starts, it will be voided!\nRead the current heat using Heat Sensor Hatches\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nMore advanced coils allow better heat control - the unit will take longer to overheat\nUnit heats by §a(5% x 0.90 ^ (Coil Tier - 1))§7 every second while running\nUnit cools by §a2%§7 base every second while not running\nCooling rate increases by an additional §a2%§7 for each second since running\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n250% §cfaster§7/§9slower§7 than singleblock machines of the same voltage\nUses §c75%§7/§9110%§7 the EU/t normally required\nGains §c4§7/§91§7 parallels per voltage tier\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines\nAdded by: §a§a§lOllie§r§7
