    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.mega_distillation_tower.tooltip=Machine Type: §eDistillery, DT, MDT§r\nStats dictated by tower mode, change mode in GUI or with a screwdriver\nHas up to 5 middle slices and 1 top slice, the amount of middle slices is the 'Tower Height'\nEach middle slice adds 2 output hatches, the top slice adds one output hatch\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§fDistillery Mode\nOutputs only one fluid in the first hatch\n§6256 * (1 + Tower Height/2)§7 Parallels\n§a200%§7 Speed\n§b50%§7 EU Usage\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§fDistillation Tower Mode\nFluids are outputted one per layer based on the slot number in NEI\nIncrease the height to output more fluid types\n§6256§7 Parallels\n§a150%§7 Speed\n§b90%§7 EU Usage\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\n§aSupports Multi-Amp and Laser Hatches!\nThis machine can run recipes regardless of tier, if given enough energy\n§6Big Oil will be pleased with this!\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines\nStructure by: §a§6Mallady§r§7
