    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.oreprocessor.tooltip_secondary.15564=§fDimensions: §613§7x§615§7x§69§7 (§6L§7x§6W§7x§6H§7) \n§fStructure: \n   §fController: §7Front center, 3rd layer\n   §6462 §fAdvanced Iridium Plated Machine Casing\n   §60-163 §fClean Stainless Steel Machine Casing\n   §698 §fIridium Sheetmetal\n   §690 §fAny Tiered Glass\n   §623 §fStainless Steel Frame Box\n   §67 §fAwakened Draconium Coil Block\n   §67 §fTitanium Gear Box Casing\n   §67 §fLarge Sieve Grate\n   §67 §fGrate Machine Casing\n   §67 §fCentrifuge Casing\n   §e1+ §fEnergy Hatch: §7Any stainless steel casing\n   §e1 §fMaintenance Hatch: §7Any stainless steel casing\n   §e1 §fMuffler Hatch: §7Any stainless steel casing\n   §e1+ §fInput Bus: §7Any stainless steel casing\n   §e1+ §fInput Hatch: §7Any stainless steel casing\n   §e1+ §fOutput Bus: §7Any stainless steel casing\n   \nSubchannel §bglass§7 determines §bGlass Tier\n§7§m------------------------------\n§fUse the Multiblock Structure §9Hologram §1Projector§f to visualize/build the structure!
    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.pcbbiochamber.name=Bio Chamber
    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.pcbbiochamber.tooltip=Machine Type: §ePCB Factory Upgrade§r\n§7Enables nanites to construct organic circuitry\n§7Unlocks the recipes for Wetware and Bioware circuit boards\n§7Place the controller block within §c16§7 blocks of the PCB Factory\n§7Left click the PCB Factory controller with a data stick,\n§7then right click this controller to link.\n§7Can connect to many PCB Factories!\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines\nAdded by: §a§9§lBlue§b§lWeabo§r§7 & §a§f§lgu§b§lid§3§l118§r§7
