    S:gt.blockmachines.multimachine.solidifier.tooltip=Machine Type: §eFluid Solidifier§r\n§4DEPRECATED - Controller will be removed in next major update!\n§4Check NEI for new Controller and conversion recipe\nCan use §eSolidifier Hatches§7 to hold different molds\n§62§7 Parallels per §fVoltage§7 Tier\nGains §63§7 Parallels per §fVoltage §7Tier per width expansion\nSpeeds up to a maximum of §a300%§7\nDecays at double the rate that it speeds up at\n§b80%§7 EU Usage\nEnergy Hatch limited by §fGlass§7 Tier\n§9Pretty Ⱄⱁⰾⰻⰴ, isn't it\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines\nAdded by: §a§9Omda§cCZ§r§7
