    S:gt.blockmachines.preciseassembler.name=精密自动组装机MT-3662
    S:gt.blockmachines.preciseassembler.tooltip=Machine Type: §ePrecise Assembler, Assembler, PrAss§r\nNo more than 7nm of error\nHas Two Modes: Precise and Normal\nUse a Screwdriver to change modes\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nPrecise Mode unlocks the ability to assemble precise components\nCasing Tier determines Maximum Recipe Tier\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nNormal Mode allows standard assembler recipes\n§fPrecise Casing§7 Tier determines §6Parallels§7\n§aImprecise§7/§9Mk-I§7/§dMK-II§7/§6MK-III§7/§cMK-IV§7->§a16§7/§932§7/§d64§7/§6128§7/§c256§7 Parallels\n§a200%§7 Speed\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nMachine Casing limits the voltage tier the machine can work on, §4§nUHV§7-tier Machine Casing unlocks all.\n§aSupports Multi-Amp and Laser Hatches!\nThis machine can only run recipes matching its average energy hatch tier\n§5780 §7Pollution per second\n§7§m-----------------------------------------\nHold §l[LSHIFT]§r§7 to display structure guidelines
